BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (costs them money. Meeting a seller in person who owed about $350,000, Morby stacked the fees at 3% plus 3% plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (about 4%, roughly 10%, which puts a listing at about $35,000 out of pocket [1GjR0GDWoyo @ 00:03:48]. He then) Tj ET
