BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 196.75 Tm (minute, or back out the week of closing. Her red flags: they have never closed a subject-to but will figure it out, cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 181.52 Tm (state underwriter requirements, will not send a draft settlement statement before closing day, or cannot name who) Tj ET
