BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Title: Build the Collateral File for Resale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Action: Assemble the underwriting package, compliance certificate, disclosures, and borrower financials into a note file) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (you retain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Detail: Call the Underwriter issues its own certificate stating the file was reviewed and is Dodd-Frank compliant, since) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (no official certificate exists [Sub2Investor - 1oenw8zc-5s @ 00:26:54]. Seller Finance Consultants says a note's value) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (is created at origination, so the full collateral file must sit in the note file for maximum resale value [Seller Finance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Consultants, Inc. - SB_vfxPYuF8 @ 00:02:02], and the ATR evidence must be retained at least three years after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (consummation [My Mortgage Trainer, Inc. - 3qzRqAVS2ZA @ 00:01:12].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (The ability-to-repay file is built on eight factors that trainers and practitioners recite almost identically. My Mortgage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Trainer lists them: current or reasonably expected income or assets other than the property itself, current employment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (status, the monthly payment on this loan calculated at the introductory or fully indexed rate whichever is higher,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (payments on any simultaneous loan on the same property, taxes, insurance and costs like HOA fees or ground rent,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (debts plus alimony and child support, the debt-to-income ratio or residual income, and credit history; the information) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (relied on must be verified and the evidence retained for at least three years after consummation [3qzRqAVS2ZA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (00:01:12]. Gibbons stresses that 'reasonable third-party verified information' means, for example, the employer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (confirming the employment status the borrower wrote on the application [r0FyiCHdxVU @ 00:01:33]. The FDIC's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (Surge Sen frames the two compliance routes: consider and verify those eight factors, or originate a qualified mortgage,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (which adds feature limits that non-QM loans do not carry [MfYdg5BCNlk @ 00:02:17]. Patrick Ritchie fills in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (underwriting habit on non-employment income such as retirement, disability, or Social Security: the rule of thumb is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (that it should be likely to continue for at least three years [NXTK3N8EVO8 @ 00:09:17].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (Hard numbers are thin, which is why operators bring their own. Bronchick says the only specific guideline in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (eight-part test is a 43% back-end debt-to-income cap, and calls it no deal killer because Bronchick's personal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (owner-carry standard is the old three-to-one rule, roughly a 33% back-end ratio [MNznbFmtOwI @ 00:19:24].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (Billheimer, a working loan officer, treats 43% as a guideline rather than an absolute requirement; the point is that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (ratio looks reasonable [z2sAmk5whKo @ 00:07:13]. Deppen runs a 57% debt-to-income compliance threshold but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (wants 50% or lower when lending personally because the math is easy to run mentally: a $1,500 payment with no other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (monthly debts needs $3,000 gross income, and adding a $500 car payment means the buyer needs $4,000 plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm ([1oenw8zc-5s @ 00:23:38]. Ritchie explains why one fixed line misleads: automated approvals through Fannie Mae,) Tj ET
