BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (always request the servicing notes from the seller during due diligence [Fusion Notes - Wt2pat2PE2w @ 00:03:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (The Horne and Sohail timeline starts before closing. The note holder downloads the servicer's package, fills out the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (investor side early, and the borrower signs their portion at the table; after closing the servicer needs the note, the deed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (of trust, the closing disclosure, and cancelled checks for ACH [adTW0EyLeRk @ 00:01:08]. The first-payment math) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (trips people up: close January 15 and the first payment is March 1, but interest from January 16 to month end and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (escrow for the stub period plus February still have to be handled, because March pays February's interest backward and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (March's escrow forward. Their fix is collecting the 15 days of interest and forward escrow at the closing table, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (forwarding the escrow piece to the servicer's trust account so nobody chases it when taxes come due [adTW0EyLeRk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (@ 00:02:18]. Within days of boarding, borrowers get a welcome letter and statement by email and mail, with check,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (Cash App, and ACH options. FIXnotes adds that onboarding is where the servicer's real work sits, uploading the CSV) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (and Excel files, after which mailing houses handle statements [5H6jVWw2QK0 @ 00:04:57]. Loan Note Exchange's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (worked example shows what gets boarded: $142,000 financed at 7% over 20 years for roughly $1,100 a month) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm ([epnA26NInuc @ 00:01:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (Once money lands, the servicing desk runs a fixed sequence. Checks sit four days to clear; then the servicer pays any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (underlying lien, pulls escrow into trust, deducts its fee, and forwards the remainder to the investor [adTW0EyLeRk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (00:09:56]. Sohail confirms the same three-to-four business day clearing window on the JKP show, which is why note) Tj ET
