BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 430.55 Tm (great: roughly $200,000 of property value, a $145,000 sale price, $30,000 down, 10 percent interest on a 30-year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.32 Tm (amortization. Then the promissory note turned out to be less than a page, and Nathan knew without reading a word that) Tj ET
