BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (mechanical trigger. Banks refuse partial payments, so a three-month delinquency snowballs into a twelve-month one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (The firm then steps in to renegotiate so the borrower's payments become investor distributions [El1w73FgjM0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (00:00:11]. Larry Hoffman explains why the paper hits the street cheap. Banks dump non-performing loans to free) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (lending capacity and satisfy regulators, at 25 to 60 percent of their actual dollar value [R_jwbBWh1LA @ 00:04:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (FIXnotes adds that charge-off is how most loans reach the secondary market in the first place [lxjMbDIOEGw @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (00:03:33]. The consensus play follows directly. Buy the debt at a deep discount, step into the lender's shoes and fix the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (payment relationship the bank was too rigid to fix. The business is the spread between what the seller accepts and what) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (the borrower ultimately pays or the collateral fetches. These operators price from that gap rather than from face value.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (The second point of agreement is collateral discipline. Bill Mencarow of Paper Source tells beginners to buy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (first-position notes only and to stick to single-family homes or farmland. Mencarow also tells them to ask whether they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (would actually want to own the property, and rules out factories and shopping centers [LuxJXWLFKHI @ 00:13:54].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (FIXnotes puts a number on why lien position matters. An unsecured loan is worth roughly 100 times less, about 50) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (basis points versus 50 cents, so checking county records for secured status and lien position comes before any bid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm ([lxjMbDIOEGw @ 00:01:23]. Sierra Davis, a data scientist who buys and originates notes, warns that junior liens carry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (wipe-out risk and pushes secured paper only [UimgP_cJydU @ 00:17:39]. Institutional buyers run the same filter at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (scale: PPR Capital Management's NPL book is 1-to-4 unit residential and 99 percent single-family detached) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm ([DEk2gIFHJiM @ 00:02:11]. The equity cushion is the other half of the rule. Mencarow calls a down payment under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (15 to 20 percent scary and says mobile homes with zero or $1,000 down usually default. The best collateral, per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (Mencarow, is an owner-occupied single-family home in a stable, diversified economy, backed by an amortized note) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (rather than a balloon. That cushion lets an operator negotiate from strength instead of hoping the market holds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Third, practitioners agree the money is made through the borrower, not the courthouse. PPR's Taylor Nelson says every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (exit decision starts with borrower intent. Nelson adds that exiting through the borrower \(reperform, season, resell\) is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (more profitable '99% of the time' [DEk2gIFHJiM @ 00:06:37]. Mencarow has been investing in notes since the 1980s,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (has never foreclosed and negotiates instead [LuxJXWLFKHI @ 00:16:46]. FIXnotes lays out six exits: full or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (discounted payoff, modification or structured settlement, cash for keys or deed in lieu, short sale, foreclosure, and an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (NPL loan sale to a local investor. It ranks foreclosure as the least favorable of the six [qxx8ymWOrGU @ 00:03:34].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (Colin Whitenack describes the same posture. Close, get a servicer involved because you cannot service the mortgage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (yourself, then enter 'problem-solving mode,' where the borrower either reperforms or gets help exiting the property) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm ([gxiK62dzE34 @ 00:00:42]. The servicer point is near-universal. PPR outsourced servicing after Dodd-Frank, Davis) Tj ET
